  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The LiPo Battery Fireproof Storage Bag is designed for safely storing and transporting LiPo batteries, providing peace of mind for hobbyists and professionals. Made from premium fiberglass with a heat-insulating aluminum foil lining, it offers excellent fire protection. Weighing only 76.5g and measuring 60*185*75mm, the bag is lightweight, portable, and spacious enough to hold multiple batteries. This reliable and easy-to-use accessory is a must-have for anyone working with LiPo batteries."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Designed specifically for safely storing and transporting Lithium batteries, our LiPo Battery Safe Bag provides peace of mind for hobbyists and professionals alike."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Constructed from high-quality fiberglass with an interior lined with heat-insulating aluminum foil, this fireproof bag offers superior protection against accidental fires."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This combination of impact resistance and fire isolation makes the LiPo Battery Safe Bag a must-have for anyone looking to store or transport LiPo batteries securely."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p><strong>The LiPo Battery Fireproof Storage Bag</strong> is designed for safely storing and transporting LiPo batteries, providing peace of mind for hobbyists and professionals. Made from premium fiberglass with a heat-insulating aluminum foil lining, it offers excellent fire protection. Weighing only 76.5g and measuring 60*185*75mm, the bag is lightweight, portable, and spacious enough to hold multiple batteries. This reliable and easy-to-use accessory is a must-have for anyone working with LiPo batteries.</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc pct_padding-in-mobile .pct_hardware-tableList pct_hardware-tableList-t-icpc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Basic Information</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_icpc pct_grad-2-pc pct_grad-1-mobile pct_hardware-tableList\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Surface Treatment</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">PVC mesh cloth</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\"> Dimensions</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">60*185*75 mm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic-p\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: bold; height: 76px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Material</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Fiberglass composite fireproof cloth</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; width: 45%; text-align: center;\">Weight</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">76.5 g</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 --></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 标题加文案结束 -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- 查看PDF --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Designed specifically for safely storing and transporting Lithium batteries, our LiPo Battery Safe Bag provides peace of mind for hobbyists and professionals alike.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Constructed from high-quality fiberglass with an interior lined with heat-insulating aluminum foil, this fireproof bag offers superior protection against accidental fires.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This combination of impact resistance and fire isolation makes the LiPo Battery Safe Bag a must-have for anyone looking to store or transport LiPo batteries securely.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The LiPo Battery Fireproof Storage Bag is designed for safely storing and transporting LiPo batteries, providing peace of mind for hobbyists and professionals. Made from premium fiberglass with a heat-insulating aluminum foil lining, it offers excellent fire protection. Weighing only 76.5g and measuring 60*185*75mm, the bag is lightweight, portable, and spacious enough to hold multiple batteries. This reliable and easy-to-use accessory is a must-have for anyone working with LiPo batteries.\n\nDesigned specifically for safely storing and transporting Lithium batteries, our LiPo Battery Safe Bag provides peace of mind for hobbyists and professionals alike.\n\nConstructed from high-quality fiberglass with an interior lined with heat-insulating aluminum foil, this fireproof bag offers superior protection against accidental fires.\n\nThis combination of impact resistance and fire isolation makes the LiPo Battery Safe Bag a must-have for anyone looking to store or transport LiPo batteries securely.",
